Run Jev spike
npx tsx --env-file=.env apps/savvist-backend/scripts/jev.spike.ts

Run Gemini spike
npx tsx --env-file=.env apps/savvist-backend/scripts/gemini.spike.ts

To run checkpointer
npx nx test savvist-backend --testPathPatterns=checkpointer.spike

To run product search
npx tsx --env-file=.env apps/savvist-backend/scripts/product-search.spike.ts "what is the best keyboard worth 3000 pesos?"